# =====================================================================
#  CRITICAL — NDA PROTECTION
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#  A .pbix file embeds its entire data model inside the file. The
#  original DMRC report is ~69 MB precisely because the real ATS data
#  is compiled into it. Committing that file would publish DMRC
#  operational data to a public repository, regardless of what the
#  README says about confidentiality.
#
#  So: every .pbix is ignored, with no exceptions.
#
#  The report IS still shareable — as a .pbip project (plain JSON +
#  TMDL, no data embedded), which is committed. Anyone can open it and
#  point it at the synthetic CSVs in data/.
# =====================================================================

*.pbix
*.pbit

# Original DMRC build — never commit, under any name
dmrc project.pbix
dashboards/
**/dmrc_dashboard.pbix

# Any real extract that may land here during local work
data/raw/
data/*_real.csv
data/ats_export*.csv

# Large regenerated datasets — the committed 50k sample is enough;
# anything bigger should be regenerated, not stored
data/sample_data_*.csv

# =====================================================================
#  Power BI project — local machine state, not part of the definition
# =====================================================================
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/editorSettings.json
**/*.abf
**/cache.abf

# =====================================================================
#  Working files — useful to me, noise to a repo visitor
# =====================================================================
_local/
docs/layout_blueprint*.svg
docs/layout_blueprint*.png
screenshots/SHOT_LIST.md
*.bak
Readme.md.bak

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
~$*
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
